; Discovery needs task events and timestamps, but no callchains or branch stack.
; Sampling needs pid,time,ip,brstack with symbol fields explicitly disabled,
; and physical callchains preserved using --no-inline. Even with a selected
; PID, perf must retain its unselected ancestors' mapping/task records.
; The mock checks both exact invocations and never runs the real perf tool.
